    "case_for": "Optical lattice clocks turned narrow optical transitions and lattice confinement into exceptionally precise, reproducible frequency standards. Katori and Ye made complementary foundational contributions, and independent development has established the approach as a mature advance in precision measurement with lasting uses in fundamental physics.",
    "case_against": "The clock field has advanced through many groups, so the award boundary must distinguish the original concept and realization from later improvements and applications. The citation should recognize the enabling clock achievement without implying that all subsequent metrology belongs to these two contributors.",
